The Actinium Convox is a weapons-development convox of [[Geography/Færrin/Calaria/index|Calaria]]. A convox is a semi-independent department, and the Calarian government and the [[Org/Iridescent Church/index|Iridescent Church]] split their work among about fifty of them. The Actinium Convox works out of its own fane, run by the [[Phenomena/Hearts|Heart]] [[Org/Actinium Convox/Gray Area|Gray Area]].

Its special project is Final Dawn, the development of the [[Phenomena/Midnight Sun|Midnight Sun]] explosive. Final Dawn was coordinated between Gray Area and [[Org/Oculum Convox/Ethics Gradient|Ethics Gradient]] of the [[Org/Oculum Convox/index|Oculum Convox]].

The convox's people wear maroon red. Missions go to its operatives through a handler, among them [[People/John Kilgore|John Kilgore]].
